{{Quote|''A social hangout world in VRChat designed primarily for furry and other communities to meet, relax, and socialize.''}}

'''Furry Hideout''' is a user-created social [[Worlds|world]] in [[VRChat]] designed primarily as a hangout space for furries and other players. The world provides a place for users to meet, relax, socialize, and spend time together.

The world was created by the VRChat user '''Lt_Shadow''', also known as '''Shadow''', who is credited as the author and creator of Furry Hideout.

Furry Hideout was originally published in April 2021 and has received multiple (3,245) updates since its creation.

==Features==

Furry Hideout contains several features intended for socializing, exploration, and relaxing with other VRChat users.

Furry Hideout allows users to leap into the air and physically move their arms up and down like wings to glide, rise, and steer around the map; with a system called open flight.

Furry Hideout creator Economy Supporters get special perks that allow them to use the in-game video player and fly using the trigger of their VR controller.

===Social hangout===

The primary purpose of Furry Hideout is to provide a casual environment where users can meet and socialize. Visitors can explore the world and interact with other players.

===Avatar support===

The world is designed to accommodate users with a variety of VRChat avatars, including furry avatars.

===Video player===

Furry Hideout includes a video player that can be used by visitors to watch supported video content together.

The video player is only accessible to Patreon supporters.

===Cave===

Furry Hideout features a cave area that can be explored by visitors. The cave is part of the world's expanded map and provides an additional area for users to explore and socialize.

==Updates==

The world has received multiple updates since its original publication in April 2021.

As of July 31, 2026, Furry Hideout has been undergoing a complete map overhaul, including a more sleek redesign of the Furry Hideout "House".

The cave areas were previously inaccessible during the map overhaul. They are now accessible to visitors.

==Trivia==

*Furry Hideout was originally published on April 28, 2021.
*The world is primarily intended as a social and hangout world.
*The world supports both PC and Android/Quest users.
*The world has been visited by a large number of VRChat users.
*The world features an explorable cave area.
*If you find a telescope, look inside it.
*The skull dog logo is named Dave.

